        "rationale": "The visible trace shows iot.measured_sensors and iot.sensor_stats (which also provided the 2024-01-15 to 2024-01-19 window via first/last timestamps, standing in for stream_extent), but it is truncated before any iot.history call is shown. The final answer's per-day totals (300, 301, 299, 301, 300 A; mean 300.2 A) are internally consistent with the reported per-phase means (100.6+104.6+95.0 = 300.2), so the peak-timestamp comparison appears grounded in real data, but the agent should ensure the ",
